# Building the .deb (later)

Not shipped yet. When ready:

```bash
# from zoth/
fakeroot dpkg-deb --build debian-build zoth-studio_0.1.0_all.deb
```

Until then, users on Debian/Ubuntu run:

```bash
./scripts/zoth deps
./scripts/zoth deps --install
./scripts/zoth
```

NullAI (`nullai.tech`) is the studio. This package is the local product.
